      "basis": "Separate physical excavations: the modeled river channel, curved lower stair/first covered flight, narrow rocky cleft beneath the upper-hall bridge, solid guest-house/theater footprints and exposed car-court apron. Cleared Qualla photographs and original HABS plans/photos control their topology. Native heights are unchanged; rock faces meet that surface and building walls retain the uphill ground. No broad whole-house or garden opening."
